  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till internationell konferens kring medicinska aborter</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Consortium for Medical Abortion will in March 2010 convene the 3rd International Conference on Medical Abortion &quot; Expanding Access to Medical Abortion&quot;. The conference will address the successes, problems and lessons learnt in introduction of medical abortion drugs in countries where they are allowed by law and those in which there are some restrictions to access.</narrative>
